# UoP / B2B Calculator (this repo)

**Compliance:** **`agents-mandatory.mdc`** requires reading **`AGENTS.md`** and **`.cursor/skills/uop-kalkulator/SKILL.md`** before calculator/payroll/B2B work — do not skip.

## Stack

- **App:** `index.html` at repo root + **`public/job-rules.json`** (B2B roles). **Vite** dev/build (`npm run dev`, `npm run build` → `dist/`).
- **CI:** `.github/workflows/ci.yml` — tests on **pull requests** only (sync/update). **Deploy:** `.github/workflows/deploy-pages.yml` — **push to `main`** (merge included); **tests before** build/upload; bump **patch**, **`CHANGELOG.md`**, **`public/release.json`**, commit **`[skip ci]`**. Site **`/UoPB2BCalculator/`** needs matching Vite `base`. UI footer loads **`release.json`**; **`public/changelog.md`** is build output (gitignored).

## When editing

- Prefer **small, focused diffs** in `index.html`; match existing patterns for i18n (`T.en` / `T.pl`, `applyLang` ids) and B2B (`searchJobRules`, `selectB2bJobRule`, **`public/job-rules.json`**).
- After payroll or B2B job data changes: **`npm run test:unit`** and **`npm test`** (Vitest contract + Playwright `tests/smoke.spec.js`).
- **Domain knowledge:** **`uop-kalkulator` skill is mandatory** when this section applies (see `agents-mandatory.mdc`).

## Do not

- Commit secrets, `.env`, or personal payslip data into the public repo.
- Change `vite.config.js` `base` without aligning **deploy workflow** and **Pages URL** (project site lives under `/UoPB2BCalculator/`).
